          {
            "title": "Schema",
            "id": 121018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby wyświetlić listę tabel, użyjemy <code>sqlite_schema</code>, ponieważ korzystamy z SQLite. <code>sqlite_schema</code> to tabela przechowująca schemat bazy danych.</p><p>Schemat zawiera informacje o bazie danych, w tym szczegóły dotyczące tabel.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"tbl_name\" /><header content=\"rootpage\" /><header content=\"sql\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE past_events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    entry int,&#xA;    attendees int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    registered int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE crew(&#xA; name varchar(255),&#xA; id int&#xA;)\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>sqlite_schema</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Table type",
            "id": 121020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Schema przechowuje wiele informacji o bazie danych. Określmy, że chcemy tylko tabele.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"type\" /><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"tbl_name\" /><header content=\"rootpage\" /><header content=\"sql\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"past_events\" /><data content=\"2\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE past_events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    entry int,&#xA;    attendees int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"events\" /><data content=\"3\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE events(&#xA;    name varchar(255),&#xA;    registered int&#xA;)\" /></row><row><data content=\"table\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"crew\" /><data content=\"4\" /><data content=\"CREATE TABLE crew(&#xA; name varchar(255),&#xA; id int&#xA;)\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>type</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>\"table\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Selecting only the name",
            "id": 121019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby utworzyć listę tabel, potrzebujemy tylko kolumny <code>name</code>. Wybierzmy ją za pomocą <code>SELECT</code>!</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"11\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /></row><row><data content=\"past_events\" /></row><row><data content=\"events\" /></row><row><data content=\"crew\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "DROP TABLE",
            "id": 121021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Skoro mamy już listę tabel, usuńmy całą tabelę <code>past_events</code> za pomocą zapytania <code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE past_events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    entry int, &#xA;    attendees int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE events( &#xA;    name varchar(255), &#xA;    registered int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;CREATE TABLE crew( &#xA; name varchar(255), &#xA; id int &#xA;); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Aisha&quot;, 342); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Matt&quot;, 123); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO crew(name, id) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Kiana&quot;, 839); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Pride Party&quot;, 10, 79); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Classical Day&quot;, 15, 76); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO past_events(name, entry, attendees) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Wine tasting&quot;, 8, 43); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Fundraiser&quot;, 37); &#xA; &#xA;INSERT INTO events(name, registered) &#xA;VALUES(&quot;Game zone&quot;, 14);\"><tables><table name=\"past_events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"entry\" /><header content=\"attendees\" /></row><row><data content=\"Pride Party\" /><data content=\"10\" /><data content=\"79\" /></row><row><data content=\"Classical Day\" /><data content=\"15\" /><data content=\"76\" /></row><row><data content=\"Wine tasting\" /><data content=\"8\" /><data content=\"43\" /></row></table><table name=\"events\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"registered\" /></row><row><data content=\"Fundraiser\" /><data content=\"37\" /></row><row><data content=\"Game zone\" /><data content=\"14\" /></row></table><table name=\"crew\"><row><header content=\"name\" /><header content=\"id\" /></row><row><data content=\"Aisha\" /><data content=\"342\" /></row><row><data content=\"Matt\" /><data content=\"123\" /></row><row><data content=\"Kiana\" /><data content=\"839\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"DROP\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"TABLE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" past_events; \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" sqlite_schema \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"&quot;table&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"4\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"10\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"name\" /></row><row><data content=\"events\" /></row><row><data content=\"crew\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>DROP</code>, a następnie <code>TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 121022,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które z poniższych stwierdzeń jest prawdziwe w odniesieniu do schematu?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Schemat zawiera informacje o bazie danych</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Schemat zawiera tylko informacje o tabelach</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Schemat zawiera informacje o bazie danych.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Baza danych zawiera kilka tabel i inne informacje strukturalne. Które stwierdzenie prawidłowo opisuje jej schemat?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Zawiera informacje o strukturze bazy danych</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Zawiera tylko wiersze zapisane w jednej tabeli</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Zawiera wyniki ostatniego zapytania</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Zawiera informacje o strukturze bazy danych.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 121023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gdzie w twojej bazie danych jest przechowywana lista tabel?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">schemat</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">zapytanie</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz schemat.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodajesz tabelę <code>payments</code>, a następnie przeglądasz listę tabel w bazie danych. Gdzie jest przechowywana ta lista?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">W schemacie</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">W zapytaniu, które utworzyło tabelę <code>payments</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">W pierwszym wierszu tabeli <code>payments</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz W schemacie.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 121024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak możesz usunąć tabelę z bazy danych SQLite?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Musisz usunąć z bazy danych SQLite całą tabelę <code>archive</code> wraz z jej strukturą. Którego polecenia należy użyć?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DELETE FROM</code>, ponieważ usunięcie każdego wiersza usuwa też tabelę</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP DATABASE</code>, ponieważ tabelę można usunąć tylko razem z bazą danych</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>DROP TABLE</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 121025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Która z poniższych składni jest poprawna do usunięcia tabeli?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE tablename</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP tablename</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>DROP TABLE tablename</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chcesz usunąć tabelę o nazwie <code>sessions</code>. Która instrukcja ma prawidłową składnię?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>DROP TABLE sessions</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP sessions</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>DROP sessions TABLE</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>DROP TABLE sessions</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
